    "yellow": {
      "500": {
        "$value": "#ffd323",
        "$description": "BETA-badge accent (#ffd323). NOT a brand colour and NOT a status colour — it exists only because no existing DS colour suited the BETA badge. Sole intended use: the BETA badge on the brand lockup. The correctly-named entry point is the component token badge.beta.bg (--sa-badge-beta-bg); color.brand.yellow / --ds-gov-yellow is retained as a deprecated legacy alias. Follow-up: rename/remove gov-yellow and move incidental highlight-star usages (NMBA, feedback) off it. Do not treat as brand or warning."
      }
